A device transmitting a conversation split across Band 2 uplink, Band 66 downlink, and a 386 MHz control channel simultaneously:

    Spectrum analyzer tuned to Band 2 — sees one third of the picture
    Spectrum analyzer tuned to Band 66 — sees one third
    Spectrum analyzer tuned to 386 MHz — sees one third
    Each view contaminated by background at that frequency

